Read as the Go module gitlab.com/gitlab-org/api/client-go/v3 at v3.46.1
(f5a1d82ee0ae2c59db6b358e6d3a430eabe726e5), the version glab 1.130.0
requires.

What is taken from it here: the HTTP method and the route template of each
request the client makes, the routes it registers with route("…") and names
in withPath, with withMethod beside them
(internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/gitlab_operations.json, written by
internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/catalogsgen from the module
catalog_sources.json pins). Nothing else of the client is kept. The catalog
of actions made from that list is Hypomnema's own
(internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/gitlab.go).

